{"zh":[{"start":3.07,"end":6.17,"text":"古希腊人奠定了基础，"},{"start":6.22,"end":8.26,"text":"让科学得以发展，"},{"start":8.3,"end":11.24,"text":"还带来了划时代的发明。"},{"start":13.25,"end":15.23,"text":"比如托勒密就计算过"},{"start":15.24,"end":19.56,"text":"行星和其他天体如何绕着地球运动。"},{"start":20.85,"end":24.25,"text":"同样榜上有名的还有第一台蒸汽机"},{"start":24.29,"end":26.75,"text":"和水泵的发明。"},{"start":28.75,"end":32.76,"text":"此外，希腊人还发明了投石弩炮之类的战争器械，"},{"start":32.8,"end":35.27,"text":"以及给士兵穿的护甲背心。"},{"start":37.21,"end":39.91,"text":"阿基米德提出了杠杆定律，"},{"start":39.95,"end":43.76,"text":"从而为力学的发展打下了基础。"},{"start":44.52,"end":48.08,"text":"而像几何和代数这样的学科，"},{"start":48.11,"end":51.45,"text":"也要归功于这些“爱智慧的人”。"}],"de":[{"start":3.07,"end":6.17,"text":"Die Griechen in der Antike legten den Grundstein","words":[["Die","这"],["Griechen","希腊人"],["in","在"],["der","这"],["Antike","古代"],["legten","奠定"],["den","这"],["Grundstein","基石"]],"reading":"迪 格里兴 因 德尔 安蒂克 莱克滕 登 格伦特施泰因"},{"start":6.22,"end":8.26,"text":"für die Entwicklung der Wissenschaften","words":[["für","为"],["die","这"],["Entwicklung","发展"],["der","这"],["Wissenschaften","科学"]],"reading":"菲尔 迪 恩特维克隆 德尔 维森沙夫滕"},{"start":8.3,"end":11.24,"text":"und brachten bahnbrechende Erfindungen hervor.","words":[["und","和"],["brachten","带来"],["bahnbrechende","划时代的"],["Erfindungen","发明"],["hervor.","出。"]],"reading":"翁特 布拉赫滕 班布雷亨德 埃尔芬东根 赫尔福尔。"},{"start":13.25,"end":15.23,"text":"Ptolemaios berechnete etwa","words":[["Ptolemaios","托勒密"],["berechnete","计算"],["etwa","例如"]],"reading":"托勒迈奥斯 贝雷希讷特 埃特瓦"},{"start":15.24,"end":19.56,"text":"wie sich Planeten und andere Himmelskörper um die Erde herum bewegen.","words":[["wie","如何"],["sich","自己"],["Planeten","行星"],["und","和"],["andere","其他"],["Himmelskörper","天体"],["um","围绕"],["die","这"],["Erde","地球"],["herum","周围"],["bewegen.","运动。"]],"reading":"维 西希 普拉内滕 翁特 安德雷 希梅尔斯克尔佩尔 乌姆 迪 埃尔德 赫鲁姆 贝韦根。"},{"start":20.85,"end":24.25,"text":"Ebenso auf die Liste gehört die erste Dampfmaschine","words":[["Ebenso","同样"],["auf","在"],["die","这"],["Liste","名单"],["gehört","属于